| **C2** | Exact re-evaluations in the m=10 search screen | "the **114** deepest candidates" | "**188** exact re-evaluations" (v3 README) | **114 ≠ 188**; all other screen parameters identical (4,194,304 points, dyadic-16/32, 500k torsion, 2,048 climbs, 64 NM polishes) |
| **C3** | Screen size | 4,194,304 (≈4.2M) | "4.2M" (v5 README) vs "**4.7M**" (v3 commit msg) | repo internally inconsistent |
| **C4** | Strictness decay | "roughly like **30/n**"; table gives nS = 29.6 / 29.9 / 30.0 at n=9,10 | "strictness decay **~33/n**" (papers README, Key results) | paper's table supports 30/n; **repo figure is stale** |
